-
-// config detail: {'description': 'Setpoint for steering wheel angle. Positive
-// for CW', 'offset': 0.0, 'precision': -0.05, 'len': 16, 'name':
-// 'ADC_CMD_SteerWheelAngle', 'is_signed_var': True, 'physical_range':
